<title>FINLAND: PK CABLES SEES IMPROVING 1997 PROFIT.</title>
<headline>PK CABLES SEES IMPROVING 1997 PROFIT.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish industrial wirings group PK Cables Oy on Monday repeated its outlook for an improving full-year 1997 profit compared to last year.</p>
<p>&quot;Profit for the whole year is estimated to be better than in the previous year,&quot; PK Cables said in a statement with its January-June results.</p>
</text>
